WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.050
This is the Signal check. It takes under a minute.

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:07.320
Tell it how you feel and how much energy you have. That stays private.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:11.163
Teachers do not see it. The app uses it to fit the plan to you.

00:00:11.163 --> 00:00:13.420
Rough day, and the plan gets lighter.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:17.324
Feeling sharp, and it gives you something with a bit more to it.

00:00:17.324 --> 00:00:21.045
Think of it like checking how your legs feel before training.

00:00:21.045 --> 00:00:22.753
Try it now: do one check in.

